This directory is the default bind-mount source for the api service's GCP
Application Default Credentials volume in docker-compose.yml (see the
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS_DIR comment there).

It is intentionally empty and committed only so `docker compose up` has a
valid directory to mount by default, even when Vertex AI / Gemini fallback
is not configured. To actually use the Gemini fallback locally, either:

  - place your own application_default_credentials.json (from
    `gcloud auth application-default login`) in this directory, or
  - set GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS_DIR to point at your real gcloud ADC
    directory instead (see docker-compose.yml).

Do not commit real credentials into this directory.
